Language Elements,Book Information,"Declare variables to store information about a book: title (String), author (String), publication year (int), and price (double). Use meaningful identifiers."
Language Elements,Boolean Logic,"Declare boolean variables and initialize them with boolean literals. Perform logical operations and print the results."
Language Elements,Character Literals,"Declare character variables and initialize them with different character literals, including Unicode escape sequences."
Language Elements,Circle Calculations,"Create a program to calculate the circumference and area of a circle. Use identifiers for the radius and pi, and a literal for the value of pi."
Language Elements,Comment Types,"Write a program that includes single-line, multi-line, and documentation comments to explain different parts of the code."
Language Elements,Escape Sequence Practice,"Write a program that uses various escape sequences in a string literal to format the output (e.g. newline, tab, backslash)."
Language Elements,Final Keyword Example,"Declare a constant using the 'final' keyword and attempt to reassign it to demonstrate that it's a compile-time error. Use comments to explain."
Language Elements,Identifier Naming Conventions,"Create a program with variables that demonstrate both good and bad identifier naming conventions. Use comments to explain why certain names are good or bad."
Language Elements,Keyword Identifier,"Write a program that declares variables using at least five different Java keywords. Add comments to explain the purpose of each variable."
Language Elements,Literal Showcase,"Declare variables of different data types and initialize them with various literals (integer, floating-point, character, string, boolean)."
Language Elements,Null Literal,"Declare an object reference variable and initialize it to the null literal. Add a comment explaining what a null reference means."
Language Elements,Student Grades,"Create a program that stores a student's name and their grades in three subjects. Use appropriate identifiers and literals."
Lifecycle,"InstanceVariableLifecycle","Explain that an instance variable's lifecycle is tied to the object it belongs to."
Lifecycle,"LocalVariableLifecycle","In a method, print a variable's value. Explain that the variable only exists while the method is executing."
ListIterator,"AddWithListIterator","Use 'listIterator.add()' to insert a new element into the list at the iterator's current position."
ListIterator,"ForwardThenBackward","Iterate all the way to the end of a list with a ListIterator, and then immediately iterate all the way back to the beginning."
ListIterator,"GetListIterator","Get a 'ListIterator' from an ArrayList of characters."
ListIterator,"GetNextIndex","While iterating forward, print the results of both 'next()' and 'nextIndex()' in each step."
ListIterator,"GetPreviousIndex","While iterating backward, print the results of both 'previous()' and 'previousIndex()'."
ListIterator,"IllegalStateSet","Call 'listIterator.set()' before calling 'next()' or 'previous()' to trigger an 'IllegalStateException'."
ListIterator,"IterateBackwards","Use the 'hasPrevious()' and 'previous()' methods of a ListIterator to traverse a list from end to start."
ListIterator,"ModifyWithSet","Use 'listIterator.set()' to replace the last element returned by 'next()' or 'previous()'."
ListIterator,"PalindromeCheck","Use a ListIterator to iterate from the start and another to iterate from the end to check if a list is a palindrome."
ListIterator,"StartFromIndex","Get a ListIterator that starts at a specific index (e.g. the middle) of a list."
Loop Break Continue,Factorial Calculation,"Calculate the factorial of a number using a do-while loop."
Loop Break Continue,Fibonacci Series,"Generate and print the first N terms of the Fibonacci series using a loop."
Loop Break Continue,Find a Number in an Array,"Use a for loop and the 'break' statement to search for a specific number in an array. Stop the loop as soon as the number is found."
Loop Break Continue,Iterate Through an Array,"Create an integer array and use an enhanced for loop (for-each) to print all its elements."
Loop Break Continue,Multiplication Table,"Print the multiplication table for a given number using a for loop."
Loop Break Continue,Nested Loop for Pattern,"Use nested for loops to print a right-angled triangle pattern of asterisks."
Loop Break Continue,Password Entry,"Write a program that repeatedly prompts a user to enter a password until they enter the correct one. Use a do-while loop."
Loop Break Continue,Prime Number Check,"Write a program that checks if a given number is prime using a for loop and a break statement."
Loop Break Continue,Print Even Numbers,"Use a for loop and the 'continue' statement to print only the even numbers between 1 and 20."
Loop Break Continue,Print Numbers 1 to 10,"Write a simple for loop that prints the numbers from 1 to 10."
Loop Break Continue,Reverse a String,"Use a for loop to iterate backward through a string and print its reverse."
Loop Break Continue,Sum of First N Natural Numbers,"Use a while loop to calculate the sum of the first N natural numbers, where N is input by the user."
Math Class,Absolute Value of MIN_VALUE,"What is the result of `Math.abs(Integer.MIN_VALUE)`? Explain why."
Math Class,Angle Normalization,"Use `Math.atan2(Math.sin(angle), Math.cos(angle))` to normalize any angle to the range -PI to PI."
Math Class,Application of PI - Circle Area,"Calculate the area of a circle with a given radius using `Math.PI` and `Math.pow()`."
Math Class,Application of PI - Circle Circumference,"Calculate the circumference of a circle with a given radius using `Math.PI`."
Math Class,Application of abs() - Difference Between Numbers,"Find the absolute difference between two numbers, regardless of which is larger."
Math Class,Application of ceil() - Shipping Costs,"Use `Math.ceil()` to calculate the number of shipping boxes needed if each box holds 10 items and you have 33 items."
Math Class,Application of ceil() vs floor() vs rint() vs round() - Comparison,"Take a positive and negative decimal number (e.g., 2.7, -2.7) and print the result of all four rounding methods to compare them."
Math Class,Application of floor() - Age Calculation,"Use `Math.floor()` on the result of a date difference to calculate a person's age in whole years."
Math Class,Application of hypot() - Vector Magnitude,"Calculate the magnitude of a 2D vector (x, y) using `Math.hypot(x, y)`."
Math Class,Application of log() - Compound Interest,"Use `Math.log()` to solve for time (t) in the continuous compound interest formula A = Pe^(rt)."
Math Class,Application of log10() - pH to H+ Concentration,"Calculate the H+ ion concentration from a given pH value using `Math.pow(10, -pH)`."
Math Class,Application of max() - Find Largest in Array,"Write a loop using `Math.max()` to find the largest number in an array of integers."
Math Class,Application of min() - Find Smallest in Array,"Write a loop using `Math.min()` to find the smallest number in an array of doubles."
Math Class,Application of pow() - Volume of a Sphere,"Calculate the volume of a sphere (4/3 * pi * r^3) using `Math.pow()` and `Math.PI`."
Math Class,Application of random() - Dice Roll,"Use `Math.random()` to simulate a six-sided die roll (generating an integer from 1 to 6)."
Math Class,Application of random() - Range Generation,"Write a method that uses `Math.random()` to generate a random integer within a given min/max range."
Math Class,Application of round() - Currency Calculation,"Round a double representing a monetary value (e.g., 45.678) to the nearest cent using `Math.round()`."
Math Class,Application of sqrt() - Distance Formula,"Implement the distance formula between two points (x1, y1) and (x2, y2) using `Math.sqrt()` and `Math.pow()`."
Math Class,Application of toDegrees() - User Output,"After a calculation results in an angle in radians, use `Math.toDegrees()` to show the result to the user in a more readable format."
Math Class,Application of toRadians() - Physics Calculation,"In a physics formula that requires an angle in radians, use `Math.toRadians()` to convert a user-supplied angle in degrees."
Math Class,Area of a Circle,"Write a program to calculate the area of a circle given its radius, using the `Math.PI` constant."
Math Class,Base 10 Logarithm,"Develop a program to compute the base 10 logarithm of a number using `Math.log10()`."
Math Class,Calculate Square Root,"Create a program that calculates and prints the square root of a user-provided number using `Math.sqrt()`."
Math Class,Casting to an Integer,"Generate a random double, multiply it by 10, and cast the result to an `int` to see the truncation."
Math Class,Ceiling of a Number,"Write a program that takes a decimal number and rounds it up to the nearest integer using `Math.ceil()`."
Math Class,Circumference of a Circle,"Develop a program to calculate the circumference of a circle using the radius and the `Math.PI` constant."
Math Class,Compare with `java.util.Random`,"Create a `Random` object and call `nextInt()`. In a comment, explain a key difference from using `Math.random()`."
Math Class,Constant - E,"Print the value of the constant `Math.E` (the base of natural logarithms)."
Math Class,Constant - PI,"Print the value of the constant `Math.PI`."
Math Class,Copying a Sign,"Use `Math.copySign()` to create a new number that has the magnitude of a number `x` and the sign of a number `y`."
Math Class,Cosine of an Angle,"Create a program to compute the cosine of an angle given in radians using `Math.cos()`."
Math Class,Cube Root of a Number,"Write a program that finds the cube root of a number using `Math.cbrt()`."
Math Class,Degrees to Radians,"Create a program to convert an angle from degrees to radians using `Math.toRadians()`."
Math Class,Distance Formula,"Calculate the distance between two points (x1, y1) and (x2, y2) in a 2D plane using the distance formula."
Math Class,Euler's Number Raised to a Power,"Create a program that calculates e raised to the power of a given number using `Math.exp()`."
Math Class,Factorial Calculation,"Develop a program to calculate the factorial of a number. (Note: This requires a loop, not a direct Math class method, but is a common mathematical exercise)."
Math Class,Fill an Array with Random Numbers,"Create an integer array of size 10 and fill it with random numbers between 1 and 100."
Math Class,Final Project - 2D Vector Class,"Create a simple Vector2D class with methods for magnitude (`hypot`), normalization, and distance, all using `Math` class methods."
Math Class,Final Project - Loan Payment Calculator,"Implement the formula for calculating monthly loan payments, which involves `Math.pow()`."
Math Class,Final Project - Simple Scientific Calculator,"Create a command-line calculator that can perform basic operations found in the Math class (sin, cos, log, pow, sqrt)."
Math Class,Find Absolute Value,"Write a program that takes a negative integer as input and prints its absolute value using `Math.abs()`."
Math Class,Find the Maximum of Two Numbers,"Write a program that finds and displays the larger of two given integers using `Math.max()`."
Math Class,Find the Minimum of Two Numbers,"Create a program to determine and print the smaller of two double values using `Math.min()`."
Math Class,Floor of a Number,"Develop a program that takes a decimal number and rounds it down to the nearest integer using `Math.floor()`."
Math Class,Generate a Basic Random Double,"Use `Math.random()` to generate and print a random double value between 0.0 (inclusive) and 1.0 (exclusive)."
Math Class,Generate a Number in a Custom Range [min, max]
Math Class,Generate a Number in a Negative Range,"Generate a random integer in a range of only negative numbers, such as -20 to -10."
Math Class,Generate a Random 4-Digit PIN,"Generate a random integer between 1000 and 9999 to simulate a 4-digit PIN."
Math Class,Generate a Random Even Number [1-100],"Write a program to generate a random even integer between 1 and 100."
Math Class,Generate a Random Lowercase Letter,"Generate a random character between 'a' and 'z'."
Math Class,Generate a Random Multiple of 10,"Generate a random integer between 1 and 100 that is a multiple of 10 (10, 20, 30...)."
Math Class,Generate a Random Number,"Write a program to generate and print a random double between 0.0 and 1.0 using `Math.random()`."
Math Class,Generate a Random Odd Number [1-100],"Write a program to generate a random odd integer between 1 and 100."
Math Class,Generate a Random Percentage,"Generate a random integer between 0 and 100 to represent a percentage."
Math Class,Generate a Random Point on a Line,"Generate a random double value between -10.0 and 10.0 to represent a point on a 1D line."
Math Class,Generate a Random Uppercase Letter,"Generate a random character between 'A' and 'Z'."
Math Class,Hypotenuse of a Right Triangle,"Given the lengths of two sides of a right triangle, calculate the hypotenuse using `Math.hypot()`."
Math Class,IEEEremainder(double, double)
Math Class,Implementing a clamp function,"Write a method `clamp(int val, int min, int max)` using `Math.max()` and `Math.min()`."
Math Class,Integer Part of a Logarithm,"Find the integer part of the base-2 logarithm of a number, which can be used to find the highest power of 2 less than the number."
Math Class,Law of Cosines,"Implement the Law of Cosines to find the third side of a triangle given two sides and the angle between them."
Math Class,Lottery Ball Picker,"Generate a single random integer between 1 and 49 for a lottery drawing."
Math Class,Monte Carlo Pi (Single Point),"Generate one random point (x, y) between 0 and 1 and check if it falls within a circle of radius 1."
Math Class,Natural Logarithm,"Write a program that calculates the natural logarithm (base e) of a number using `Math.log()`."
Math Class,Next Floating-Point Value,"Given a double, find the next floating-point number in the direction of positive infinity using `Math.nextUp()`."
Math Class,Overflow with addExact()","Demonstrate the `ArithmeticException` thrown by `addExact()` by adding `Integer.MAX_VALUE` and 1."
Math Class,Overflow with incrementExact()","Use `incrementExact()` on `Integer.MAX_VALUE` to trigger an `ArithmeticException`."
Math Class,Overflow with toIntExact()","Call `toIntExact()` with a long value greater than `Integer.MAX_VALUE` to trigger an `ArithmeticException`."
Math Class,Pick a Random Number from 1 to 10,"Generate a random integer between 1 and 10 (inclusive)."
Math Class,Power of a Number,"Develop a program that computes `x` raised to the power of `y` (x^y), where `x` and `y` are inputs, using `Math.pow()`."
Math Class,Probability Simulation (25% Chance),"Write a program that simulates an event with a 25% chance of success, printing 'Success' or 'Failure'."
Math Class,Quadratic Formula Solver,"Write a program that finds the roots of a quadratic equation (ax^2 + bx + c = 0) using the quadratic formula."
Math Class,Radians to Degrees,"Write a program that converts an angle from radians to degrees using `Math.toDegrees()`."
Math Class,Random 2D Coordinate,"Generate two random integers, `x` and `y`, both between -100 and 100, to represent a 2D coordinate."
Math Class,Random Angle in Degrees,"Generate a random integer between 0 and 360 to represent an angle."
Math Class,Random Angle in Radians,"Generate a random double between 0.0 and 2 * Math.PI to represent an angle in radians."
Math Class,Random Brightness Level,"Generate a random double between 0.0 and 1.0 to represent a brightness or opacity level."
Math Class,Random Card Suit,"Generate a random integer from 1 to 4 to represent a card suit (Clubs, Diamonds, Hearts, Spades)."
Math Class,Random Card Value (2-10),"Generate a random integer from 2 to 10 to represent a numbered playing card."
Math Class,Random Character from a String,"Given a string, use `Math.random()` to generate an index and print the character at that position."
Math Class,Random Choice from Three Options,"Simulate a choice between three options (A, B, C) by generating a random number."
Math Class,Random Day of the Month,"Generate a random integer between 1 and 31 to represent a day of the month."
Math Class,Random Floating-Point Number in a Range,"Generate a random double value in a custom range, for example, between 50.0 and 100.0."
Math Class,Random Month of the Year,"Generate a random integer between 1 and 12 to represent a month."
Math Class,Random RGB Color Value,"Generate a random integer between 0 and 255 to represent a single RGB color component."
Math Class,Random Test Score,"Generate a random integer between 0 and 100 to simulate a student's test score."
Math Class,Random True or False,"Generate a random boolean value (`true` or `false`) using `Math.random()`."
Math Class,Random Wait Time,"Generate a random integer between 500 and 2000 to simulate a random wait time in milliseconds."
Math Class,Random Walk Step,"Simulate a single step of a random walk: generate a number and move +1 if it's > 0.5, and -1 otherwise."
Math Class,Roll a Six-Sided Die,"Use `Math.random()` to generate a random integer between 1 and 6 (inclusive) to simulate a die roll."
Math Class,Round a Number,"Create a program that rounds a floating-point number to the nearest whole number using `Math.round()`."
Math Class,Rounding to Two Decimal Places,"Write a program that takes a double and rounds it to two decimal places. This requires combining multiplication, `Math.round()`, and division."
Math Class,Scaling the Output,"Generate a random double, multiply it by 1000, and print the result to demonstrate scaling."
Math Class,Select a Random Array Element,"Create a string array and use `Math.random()` to generate a random index to select and print an element."
Math Class,Select a Random Winner,"Given a list of 5 names, use `Math.random()` to randomly select and print one winner."
Math Class,Signum Function,"Create a program that determines the sign of a number (-1, 0, or 1) using `Math.signum()`."
Math Class,Simple Harmonic Motion,"Simulate a point's position in simple harmonic motion using `Math.cos()` over a series of time steps."
Math Class,Simple Password Character,"Generate a random character that is either a lowercase letter or a digit (0-9)."
Math Class,Simulate a Biased Coin (70% Heads),"Generate a random number to simulate a biased coin that lands on 'Heads' 70% of the time."
Math Class,Simulate a Coin Flip,"Generate a random number and print 'Heads' if it's less than 0.5, and 'Tails' otherwise."
Math Class,Sine of an Angle,"Write a program that calculates the sine of an angle given in radians using `Math.sin()`."
Math Class,Special Case - Division by Zero in atan2()","Observe the results of `Math.atan2(y, 0.0)` for positive and negative y."
Math Class,Special Case - log(0),"Calculate `Math.log(0.0)` and print the result (Negative Infinity)."
Math Class,Special Case - pow(x, 0)
Math Class,Special Case - sqrt(-1),"Calculate `Math.sqrt(-1.0)` and print the result (NaN)."
Math Class,Tangent of an Angle,"Develop a program that finds the tangent of an angle given in radians using `Math.tan()`."
Math Class,Underflow with subtractExact()","Demonstrate the `ArithmeticException` by subtracting 1 from `Integer.MIN_VALUE` using `subtractExact()`."
Math Class,Volume of a Sphere,"Calculate the volume of a sphere given its radius, using `Math.PI` and `Math.pow()`."
Math Class,`round()` vs `rint()` behavior","Compare the results of `Math.round(2.5)` and `Math.rint(2.5)` to see how they handle ties."
