System Class,Get User's Account Name,"Print the user's account name using `System.getProperty('user.name')`."
System Class,Get User's Home Directory,"Get and print the user's home directory path using `System.getProperty('user.home')`."
System Class,Get a System Property,"Use `System.getProperty()` to get and print the version of the Java runtime (property: `java.version`)."
System Class,Identity Hash Code,"Create an object and print its identity hash code using `System.identityHashCode()`."
