System Class,Java VM Name Property,"Get and print the name of the Java Virtual Machine implementation using `System.getProperty('java.vm.name')`."
System Class,Java Vendor Property,"Get and print the Java runtime environment vendor using `System.getProperty('java.vendor')`."
System Class,Line Separator,"Print a multi-line string using the system-dependent line separator obtained from `System.lineSeparator()`."
System Class,List All System Properties,"Use `System.getProperties()` and loop through the result to print all available system properties."
