System Class,Redirect Standard Error,"Use `System.setErr()` to redirect all error messages to a specific log file."
System Class,Redirect Standard Input,"Use `System.setIn()` to redirect standard input from a file, simulating user input."
System Class,Redirect Standard Output,"Use `System.setOut()` to redirect all standard output to a file stream for the duration of the program."
