Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Iterate with 'for-each',"Given a 2D String array, use nested 'for-each' loops to print every element."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Print as Grid,"Given a 2D array, use nested loops to print it as a grid (e.g., each row on a new line, with elements separated by spaces)."
