Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Iterate a Specific Column,"Given a 2D array, ask the user for a column index 'c'. Iterate through and print all elements in column 'c'."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Initialize with Loop (Sequential),"Declare a 4x4 integer array. Use nested loops to fill it with sequential numbers (0, 1, 2, ... 15)."
