Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Initialize with Loop (Column Index),"Declare a 5x3 integer array. Use nested loops to fill each element with its column index."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Initialize with Loop (Sum of Indices),"Declare a 4x4 integer array. Fill each element at [r][c] with the value (r + c)."
