Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Print from User Array,"After populating a 2D array from user input, use nested loops to print it back out in grid format."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Sum of All Elements,"Given a 2D integer array, write code to calculate and print the sum of all its elements."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Average of All Elements,"Given a 2D double array, calculate and print the average of all its elements."
