Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Count Occurrences,"Given a 2D integer array and a target value, count and print how many times the target value appears in the array."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Linear Search (Value),"Given a 2D String array and a target string, write a program to find if the target string exists. Print 'Found' or 'Not Found'."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Linear Search (Index),"Given a 2D integer array and a target value, find and print the row/col index of its *first* occurrence. If not found, print '[-1, -1]'."
