Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Count Positive Numbers,"Count and print the number of positive values in a 2D integer array (do not count zero)."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Count Zeros,"Count and print the number of times the value 0 appears in a 2D integer array."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Sum of Even Numbers,"Calculate and print the sum of only the even numbers in a 2D integer array."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Sum of a Specific Row,"Given a 2D integer array, ask the user for a row index and print the sum of all elements in that row."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Sum of a Specific Column,"Given a 2D integer array, ask the user for a column index and print the sum of all elements in that column."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Sum of Each Row,"Given a 2D integer array, calculate and print the sum of each row. (e.g., 'Row 0 Sum: 15', 'Row 1 Sum: 12')."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Sum of Each Column,"Given a 2D integer array, calculate and print the sum of each column."
