Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Store Column Sums in 1D Array,"Given a 2D integer array, create a new 1D array where each element is the sum of the corresponding column in the 2D array."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Find Row with Largest Sum,"Given a 2D integer array, find and print the index of the row that has the largest sum."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Find Column with Smallest Sum,"Given a 2D integer array, find and print the index of the column that has the smallest sum."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Average of Each Row,"Given a 2D double array, calculate and print the average of each row."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Average of Each Column,"Given a 2D double array, calculate and print the average of each column."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Maximum in Each Row,"Given a 2D integer array, find and print the maximum value in each row."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Minimum in Each Column,"Given a 2D integer array, find and print the minimum value in each column."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Sum of Main Diagonal,"Given a square 2D integer array, calculate and print the sum of the elements on the main diagonal (top-left to bottom-right)."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Sum of Anti-Diagonal,"Given a square 2D integer array, calculate and print the sum of the elements on the anti-diagonal (top-right to bottom-left)."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Print Main Diagonal,"Given a square 2D array, print only the elements on the main diagonal."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Print Anti-Diagonal,"Given a square 2D array, print only the elements on the anti-diagonal."
