Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Create Transpose (New Array),"Given a 2D integer array, create a *new* 2D array that is its transpose (rows and columns are swapped)."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Swap Two Rows,"Given a 2D array and two row indices, write code to swap all elements in those two rows."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Swap Two Columns,"Given a 2D array and two column indices, write code to swap all elements in those two columns."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Fill with Value,"Declare a 5x5 integer array. Use nested loops to fill the entire array with the value -1."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Fill with 'Arrays.fill' (1D),"Show how 'Arrays.fill()' can be used to fill each row of a 2D array with a value (by iterating through the rows)."
