Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Print with 'Arrays.deepToString',"Use 'Arrays.deepToString()' to print the contents of a 2D array in a user-friendly format."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Add Two Matrices,"Given two 2D integer arrays of the same size, create a new array that is their sum (element by element)."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Subtract Two Matrices,"Given two 2D integer arrays of the same size, create a new array that is their difference (element by element)."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Scalar Multiplication,"Given a 2D integer array and a single integer 'scalar', create a new array where each element is multiplied by the scalar."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Replace All,"Given a 2D integer array, a target value, and a replacement value, replace all occurrences of the target with the replacement."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Sum of Border Elements,"Given a 2D integer array, calculate and print the sum of only the elements on the border (first/last row and first/last column)."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Count Strings of Length,"Given a 2D String array and an integer 'n', count how many strings in the array have a length of exactly 'n'."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Find Longest String,"Given a 2D String array, find and print the longest string in the entire array."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Find Shortest String Location,"Given a 2D String array, find and print the row/col index of the shortest string."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Boolean Array Check (All),"Given a 2D boolean array, check if all values are 'true'. Print 'All true' or 'Not all true'."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Boolean Array Check (Any),"Given a 2D boolean array, check if at least one value is 'true'. Print 'At least one true' or 'All false'."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Declare Jagged Array,"Declare a 2D integer array where the first row has 3 elements, the second has 5, and the third has 2."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Initialize Jagged Array,"Using the 'new' keyword, declare and initialize a jagged array with 3 rows, then initialize each row to a different size (e.g., new int[3][], then arr[0] = new int[5], etc.)."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Initialize Jagged Array (Literals),"Declare and initialize a jagged array using nested curly braces with varying numbers of elements in each inner brace set."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Iterate Jagged Array,"Given a jagged integer array, use nested 'for' loops to print all its elements."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Iterate Jagged Array ('for-each'),"Given a jagged String array, use nested 'for-each' loops to print all its elements."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Jagged Array Row Lengths,"Given a jagged array, write a loop that prints the length of each row."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Find Longest Row (Jagged),"Given a jagged array, find and print the index of the row with the most elements."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Total Elements in Jagged Array,"Write a program to calculate and print the total number of elements in a jagged array."
Multi-Dimensional Arrays,Sum of Jagged Array,"Given a jagged integer array, calculate and print the sum of all its elements."
