Study,"Data and Expressions - EscapeSequenceTab","Write a single `println` statement that prints 'Column1', a tab character, and 'Column2'."
Study,"Data and Expressions - EscapeSequenceQuote","Write a single `println` statement that prints the text: He said, 'Java is fun!'."
Study,"Data and Expressions - EscapeSequenceBackslash","Write a single `println` statement that prints the file path: C:\Java\Files."
Study,"Data and Expressions - IntDeclaration","Declare an integer variable named `quantity`."
