Study,"Data and Expressions - FinalVariableError","Try to change the value of the `MAX_SCORE` constant declared in the previous exercise. Observe the compiler error."
Study,"Data and Expressions - ByteVariableRange","Declare a `byte` variable and assign it the smallest possible value. Print it."
Study,"Data and Expressions - ShortVariableRange","Declare a `short` variable and assign it the largest possible value. Print it."
Study,"Data and Expressions - LongVariableDeclaration","Declare a `long` variable named `worldPopulation` and initialize it to 7,000,000,000."
Study,"Data and Expressions - FloatVariableDeclaration","Declare a `float` variable named `price` and initialize it to 19.99. Remember the suffix."
